<h2>What It Means</h2>
<p>United will now face Real Marbella in the final next month, a rematch of the 2019 showpiece which Marbella won on penalties. For Riverside, it is a devastating end to a campaign that had promised so much.</p>

<p>For Marcus Bell, a player who has spent much of the season on the bench, it was a moment of personal redemption. "I've dreamed about that since I was a kid," he said afterwards. "You don't think in that moment. You just hit it."</p>

